WEBVTT

00:12:28.553 --> 00:12:30.771
but we're going to break that rule today.

00:12:30.795 --> 00:12:34.819
So please welcome onto the stage Freya ...

00:12:34.843 --> 00:12:36.922
(Applause)

00:12:36.946 --> 00:12:41.710
and her trainers Mark and Sarah.

00:12:41.734 --> 00:12:44.919
(Applause)

00:12:44.943 --> 00:12:47.071
Of course, this is
the real star of the show.

00:12:47.095 --> 00:12:48.152
(Laughter)

00:12:48.176 --> 00:12:53.421
OK, so now what I'm going to ask is
if you can all just be a little bit quiet,

00:12:53.445 --> 00:12:54.666
not move around too much.

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:57.071
This is a very, very strange
environment for Freya.

00:12:57.095 --> 00:12:59.230
She's having a good look at you guys now.

00:12:59.254 --> 00:13:02.047
So let's stay as calm as possible.
That would be great.